            <div class="image-grid">
                <img src="~/images/truck.jpg" style="height: 250px;">
                    <img src="~/images/plane.jpg" style="height: 250px;">
                    </div>
            <div class="text-content">
                <h2>OUR<span>VISION</span></h2>
                <p>To become a leading, technology-driven logistics provider in South Africa and globally, delivering reliable, efficient, and innovative freight solutions that empower businesses through seamless transportation and operational excellence.</p>
                <p>En Massé strives to set the standard for modern logistics management by leveraging smart systems, real-time tracking, and data-driven decision-making to ensure dependable and secure cargo delivery.</p>
            </div>
            
        </section>

